From 9c1251bbf8f180d54650f4b3603a2cfa28fda885 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 16:52:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] MAINTAINERS: add the HiSilicon AIAO audio drivers entry

The AIAO audio block has three drivers and no maintainer entry. The I2S
port driver, the sound card and the internal DAC codec are all
DT-binding drivers under linux-sound.

Register the three drivers with their bindings in one entry.

Signed-off-by: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
---
 MAINTAINERS | 11 +++++++++++
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+)

--- a/MAINTAINERS
+++ b/MAINTAINERS
@@ -12032,6 +12032,17 @@ F:	drivers/net/dsa/hirschmann/*
 F:	include/linux/platform_data/hirschmann-hellcreek.h
 F:	net/dsa/tag_hellcreek.c
 
+HISILICON AIAO AUDIO DRIVERS
+M:	David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
+L:	linux-sound@vger.kernel.org
+S:	Supported
+F:	Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/hisilicon,hi3716cv200-adac.yaml
+F:	Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/hisilicon,hi3798mv100-aiao-card.yaml
+F:	Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/hisilicon,hi3798mv100-aiao-i2s.yaml
+F:	sound/soc/hisilicon/histb-adac.c
+F:	sound/soc/hisilicon/histb-aiao-card.c
+F:	sound/soc/hisilicon/histb-aiao-i2s.c
+
 HISILICON DMA DRIVER
 M:	Zhou Wang <wangzhou1@hisilicon.com>
 M:	Longfang Liu <liulongfang@huawei.com>
